commit message:
fet (boploader, bopwriter, cocowriter): All distinguish between
different bop datasets.

a custom property is_bop_object which will be set to True (-> easy
selection, so we don't have to use 'model_path');
a custom property bop_dataset which will be set to the corresponding
dataset name;
create a subfolder in bop_data for each present bop dataset;
use bop_dataset as a supercategory in coco writer.

